{"id":"n15606-2-6","stage":3,"title":"손질 · 修改","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15606-2-6-1","ko":"제 글에 더 고칠 부분은 없나요?","zh":"我的文章还有需要修改的地方吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"글에","meaning":"文章","explanation":"글：文章；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"글","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59226","senseId":"1","lemma":"글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글에","audio":"/audio/98d9008640c0e7dc1867.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"고칠","meaning":"修改，改变","explanation":"고치다：修改，改变；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"고치다","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18381","senseId":"4","lemma":"고치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고칠","audio":"/audio/2291ae29bd011842966d.mp3"}},{"text":"부분은","meaning":"部分","explanation":"부분：部分；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"부분","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65853","senseId":"1","lemma":"부분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부분은","audio":"/audio/02b817b32edb3b13b7e6.mp3"}},{"text":"없나요?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없나요","audio":"/audio/bb881468b72eb5f65cff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"f77a9ef73a929938","term":"글","zh":"文章","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3","entryId":"59226","definition":"将想法或事情等用文字表达出来。","pronunciation":["글"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"594fd99add1f497b","term":"고치다","zh":"修改，改变","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3","entryId":"18381","definition":"使和以前不一样。","pronunciation":["고치다"]},{"id":"204cbadbdb5dd2ee","term":"부분","zh":"部分","audio":"/audio/204cbadbdb5dd2ee0cb9.mp3","entryId":"65853","definition":"构成整体的小范围；或指把整体分为多个时的其中一个。","pronunciation":["부분"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某个事实或现象在现实里不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d5ebb895334d1bce648e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15606-2-6-2","ko":"아니, 더 손질을 할 데가 없는 것 같은데. 아주 훌륭해.","zh":"没有，我觉得已经没有需要再润色的地方了。非常出色。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没。","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"손질을","meaning":"修改，修理","explanation":"손질：修改，修理；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"손질","audio":"/audio/57cf31b47eedddd5bb3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15606","senseId":"2","lemma":"손질","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손질을","audio":"/audio/86daf13ac10a23d7f9b1.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"데가","meaning":"事情，东西。","explanation":"데：事情，东西；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"2","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"데가","audio":"/audio/3b0accbf1bd1715fbac6.mp3"}},{"text":"없는","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없는","audio":"/audio/9064a5c0bfdea4101ee3.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"훌륭해.","meaning":"优秀，卓越","explanation":"훌륭하다：优秀，卓越；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"훌륭하다","audio":"/audio/086a96db168cd21a589e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73249","senseId":"1","lemma":"훌륭하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"훌륭해","audio":"/audio/6273f42dd428fb688746.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bcf26f704fdac00f","term":"아니","zh":"不，没","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3","entryId":"65980","definition":"用于表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["아니"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"57cf31b47eedddd5","term":"손질","zh":"修改，修理","audio":"/audio/57cf31b47eedddd5bb3e.mp3","entryId":"15606","definition":"重新改动并整理已经做好的东西。","pronunciation":["손질"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"事情，东西。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"事情，东西。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某个事实或现象在现实里不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"086a96db168cd21a","term":"훌륭하다","zh":"优秀，卓越","audio":"/audio/086a9